WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Stop being the only database. Externalize founder knowledge without automating judgment.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Externalize decisions and research.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Connect IP, risk and signals.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Expose stale or missing evidence.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep the human decision owner.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Make founder memory inspectable.
